3.
Definitions.
- In these Regulations, unless the context otherwise requires:
(i)
`Act' means All India Council for Technical Education Act, 1987 (52 of 1987);
(ii)
`Council' means the All India Council for Technical Education constituted under Section 3 of the Act;
(iii)
`Management Institutions' herein shall mean the institutions offering PGDM courses approved by AICTE;
